              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Toleranz — \"tolerance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In einer guten Schule lernen die Kinder Toleranz. In a good school the children learn tolerance."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "No plural in this sense. The adjective is tolerant."
            }
